@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
title Civ13 crafting transaction skeleton
actor Player
participant "Stack menu / Topic" as S
participant "Material recipes" as M
participant "Map research / config data" as R
participant produce_recipe as P
participant do_after as D
participant "World objects" as W
Player -> S : attack_self / list_recipes
S -> M : applicable recipes
M -> R : faction/race, era, node or legacy thresholds
R --> M : allowed records
M --> S : stack_recipe datums / result_type
Player -> S : make, sublist, multiplier
S -> S : actor state / active hand / multiplier gates
S -> P : set can_build_recipe FALSE; produce_recipe
P -> P : feature gates, content-specific prompts and inputs
opt timed recipe
P -> D : adjusted duration
loop cooperative waits
D -> D : actor / location / hand / target checks
end
D --> P : success or cancellation
end
alt cancellation / failed revalidation
P --> S : branch-specific cleanup and return
else commit admitted
P -> P : revalidate special inputs and ownership
P -> S : use(required, actor)
opt exact handle and successful main debit
P -> P : clear actual equipment slot; qdel handle
end
P -> W : new recipe.result_type; configure result
end
P --> S : return; release can_build_recipe
note over P,W
Actual debit order and cancellation vary by recipe branch.
This skeleton is not a blanket atomicity guarantee.
end note
